  - speakerName: 'Jewel:'
    line: "\"Yeah, I patched up his tanks and pressure gauge just last week. Kept
      askin\u2019 me if I could \u2018seal something for deep pressure\u2019\u2014deeper
      than I\u2019d recommend for a solo dive. Didn\u2019t say where he was goin\u2019.
      Just said, \u2018If it holds, I\u2019ll owe you a story.\u2019 I never liked
      that kind of talk.\u201D"
    choices: []
